; 25-context.kurt

; `context` is `trail`'s (24-trail.kurt) more detailed sibling: instead of one
; compact line, it prints every open level on its own line, with a little
; more information about each (e.g. what is being `assume`d there).

bool A, B
use A implies B

context

show A implies B "demo"
proof
    context
    assume A
        context
        B
qed
